{"seq":1,"slug":"logging-stack","title":"日志体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/monitoring-and-operations/logging-stack","wordCount":977,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"日志体系\">日志体系</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>容器化环境给日志管理带来三大挑战：<strong>临时性</strong>（容器销毁即丢失）、<strong>分散性</strong>（日志分散在多个节点）、<strong>异构性</strong>（多语言多框架格式不一）。应对之道是集中化收集与结构化。</p>\n<p>关键概念有三：<strong>结构化日志</strong> 用 JSON 等机器可解析格式输出，其中 <code>trace_id</code> 是跨服务关联同一请求的唯一标识；<strong>EFK 栈</strong>（Fluent Bit + Elasticsearch + Kibana）是 Kubernetes 日志的主流方案；<strong>分层存储</strong>（热/温/冷/归档）在查询性能与存储成本之间取得平衡。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"日志的价值与挑战\">日志的价值与挑战</h2><p>在容器化环境中，日志是排查问题的第一手线索。但容器的临时性和大规模部署给日志管理带来了独特挑战——容器销毁后日志消失、数百个容器的日志分散在不同节点、日志格式不统一导致难以检索。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 日志挑战&#10;        C1[容器 1] --&gt;|stdout| N1[节点 1]&#10;        C2[容器 2] --&gt;|stdout| N1&#10;        C3[容器 3] --&gt;|stdout| N2[节点 2]&#10;        C4[容器 4] --&gt;|stdout| N2&#10;    end&#10;    N1 --&gt;|收集| AGG[集中式日志平台]&#10;    N2 --&gt;|收集| AGG&#10;    AGG --&gt; SEARCH[搜索与分析]\">graph TD\n    subgraph 日志挑战\n        C1[容器 1] --&gt;|stdout| N1[节点 1]\n        C2[容器 2] --&gt;|stdout| N1\n        C3[容器 3] --&gt;|stdout| N2[节点 2]\n        C4[容器 4] --&gt;|stdout| N2\n    end\n    N1 --&gt;|收集| AGG[集中式日志平台]\n    N2 --&gt;|收集| AGG\n    AGG --&gt; SEARCH[搜索与分析]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>传统环境</th>\n<th>容器化环境</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日志持久性</td>\n<td>文件系统持久存储</td>\n<td>容器销毁即丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志位置</td>\n<td>固定服务器路径</td>\n<td>分散在多个节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志规模</td>\n<td>数十台服务器</td>\n<td>数百到数千个容器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志格式</td>\n<td>相对统一</td>\n<td>多语言多框架异构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志关联</td>\n<td>IP 地址关联</td>\n<td>Pod 名动态变化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"结构化日志\">结构化日志</h2><p>结构化日志（Structured Logging）使用 JSON 等机器可解析的格式输出日志，取代传统的纯文本日志。这是可观测性的基础。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"echo &#39;{&quot;timestamp&quot;:&quot;2026-04-01T10:30:00Z&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:&quot;info&quot;,&quot;service&quot;:&quot;api&quot;,&quot;trace_id&quot;:&quot;abc123&quot;,&quot;message&quot;:&quot;Request processed&quot;,&quot;method&quot;:&quot;GET&quot;,&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/api/users&quot;,&quot;status&quot;:200,&quot;duration_ms&quot;:45}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{\"timestamp\":\"2026-04-01T10:30:00Z\",\"level\":\"info\",\"service\":\"api\",\"trace_id\":\"abc123\",\"message\":\"Request processed\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"path\":\"/api/users\",\"status\":200,\"duration_ms\":45}'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对比传统日志：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"echo &#39;[2026-04-01 10:30:00] INFO: Request processed GET /api/users 200 45ms&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '[2026-04-01 10:30:00] INFO: Request processed GET /api/users 200 45ms'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>纯文本日志</th>\n<th>结构化 JSON 日志</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>人类可读性</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机器解析</td>\n<td>需要正则匹配</td>\n<td>直接解析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段查询</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持任意字段过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统计分析</td>\n<td>困难</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储效率</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>略低（可压缩）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: ConfigMap&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: app-config&#10;data:&#10;  LOG_FORMAT: json&#10;  LOG_LEVEL: info\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ConfigMap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app-config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  LOG_FORMAT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  LOG_LEVEL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">info</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 结构化日志的关键字段包括 <code>timestamp</code>、<code>level</code>、<code>service</code>、<code>trace_id</code> 和 <code>message</code>。其中 <code>trace_id</code> 尤为重要——它是在分布式系统中关联同一请求跨服务日志的唯一标识。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"efk-日志栈\">EFK 日志栈</h2><p>EFK（Elasticsearch + Fluentd/Fluent Bit + Kibana）是 Kubernetes 环境中最流行的日志解决方案。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 应用层&#10;        POD1[Pod 1&lt;br/&gt;stdout/stderr]&#10;        POD2[Pod 2&lt;br/&gt;stdout/stderr]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 采集层&#10;        FB[Fluent Bit&lt;br/&gt;DaemonSet]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 存储层&#10;        ES[Elasticsearch&lt;br/&gt;集群]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 展示层&#10;        KB[Kibana&lt;br/&gt;可视化]&#10;    end&#10;    POD1 --&gt; FB&#10;    POD2 --&gt; FB&#10;    FB --&gt; ES&#10;    ES --&gt; KB\">graph LR\n    subgraph 应用层\n        POD1[Pod 1&lt;br/&gt;stdout/stderr]\n        POD2[Pod 2&lt;br/&gt;stdout/stderr]\n    end\n    subgraph 采集层\n        FB[Fluent Bit&lt;br/&gt;DaemonSet]\n    end\n    subgraph 存储层\n        ES[Elasticsearch&lt;br/&gt;集群]\n    end\n    subgraph 展示层\n        KB[Kibana&lt;br/&gt;可视化]\n    end\n    POD1 --&gt; FB\n    POD2 --&gt; FB\n    FB --&gt; ES\n    ES --&gt; KB</pre><h3 id=\"fluent-bit-配置\">Fluent Bit 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;kind: DaemonSet&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: fluent-bit&#10;  namespace: logging&#10;spec:&#10;  selector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: fluent-bit&#10;  template:&#10;    metadata:&#10;      labels:&#10;        app: fluent-bit&#10;    spec:&#10;      containers:&#10;        - name: fluent-bit&#10;          image: fluent/fluent-bit:3.0&#10;          volumeMounts:&#10;            - name: varlog&#10;              mountPath: /var/log&#10;            - name: config&#10;              mountPath: /fluent-bit/etc/&#10;      volumes:&#10;        - name: varlog&#10;          hostPath:&#10;            path: /var/log&#10;        - name: config&#10;          configMap:&#10;            name: fluent-bit-config\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DaemonSet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fluent-bit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">logging</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fluent-bit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fluent-bit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fluent-bit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fluent/fluent-bit:3.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          volumeMounts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">varlog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              mountPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/var/log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              mountPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/fluent-bit/etc/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">varlog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          hostPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/var/log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          configMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fluent-bit-config</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl logs -n logging fluent-bit-xxxxx --tail 50&#10;&#10;kubectl get pods -n logging\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logging</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fluent-bit-xxxxx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --tail</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pods</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logging</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>部署方式</th>\n<th>资源需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Fluent Bit</td>\n<td>日志采集转发</td>\n<td>DaemonSet</td>\n<td>低（50m CPU）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fluentd</td>\n<td>日志聚合处理</td>\n<td>Deployment</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Elasticsearch</td>\n<td>日志存储索引</td>\n<td>StatefulSet</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kibana</td>\n<td>可视化查询</td>\n<td>Deployment</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"日志查询与分析\">日志查询与分析</h2><p>有效的日志查询能力是快速定位问题的关键。掌握日志平台的查询语法可以将排障时间从小时缩短到分钟。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl logs deployment/api --tail 100 -f&#10;&#10;kubectl logs deployment/api --since=1h | grep ERROR&#10;&#10;kubectl logs -l app=api --all-containers --prefix\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/api</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --tail</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/api</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --since=1h</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ERROR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app=api</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --all-containers</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prefix</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Elasticsearch 查询示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"curl -X GET &quot;localhost:9200/logs-*/_search&quot; -H &#39;Content-Type: application/json&#39; -d &#39;{&#10;  &quot;query&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;bool&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;must&quot;: [&#10;        {&quot;match&quot;: {&quot;level&quot;: &quot;error&quot;}},&#10;        {&quot;match&quot;: {&quot;service&quot;: &quot;api&quot;}},&#10;        {&quot;range&quot;: {&quot;@timestamp&quot;: {&quot;gte&quot;: &quot;now-1h&quot;}}}&#10;      ]&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;sort&quot;: [{&quot;@timestamp&quot;: &quot;desc&quot;}],&#10;  &quot;size&quot;: 50&#10;}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GET</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"localhost:9200/logs-*/_search\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -H</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Content-Type: application/json'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"query\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"bool\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"must\": [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        {\"match\": {\"level\": \"error\"}},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        {\"match\": {\"service\": \"api\"}},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        {\"range\": {\"@timestamp\": {\"gte\": \"now-1h\"}}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"sort\": [{\"@timestamp\": \"desc\"}],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"size\": 50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>查询场景</th>\n<th>查询方式</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单 Pod 实时日志</td>\n<td>kubectl logs -f</td>\n<td>kubectl</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多 Pod 聚合日志</td>\n<td>标签选择 + 前缀</td>\n<td>kubectl</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨服务错误追踪</td>\n<td>trace_id 关联查询</td>\n<td>Kibana</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误趋势分析</td>\n<td>时间序列聚合</td>\n<td>Kibana</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志告警</td>\n<td>阈值触发通知</td>\n<td>ElastAlert</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>stern</code> 工具可以更方便地查看多 Pod 的实时日志：<code>stern api --tail 20 --since 10m</code>。它支持正则匹配 Pod 名称、彩色输出和多容器日志合并展示，比原生 <code>kubectl logs</code> 更适合日常调试。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"日志保留与成本\">日志保留与成本</h2><p>日志存储是基础设施成本的重要组成部分。合理的保留策略平衡可追溯性和成本控制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 日志分层存储&#10;        HOT[热存储&lt;br/&gt;最近 7 天&lt;br/&gt;SSD]&#10;        WARM[温存储&lt;br/&gt;7-30 天&lt;br/&gt;HDD]&#10;        COLD[冷存储&lt;br/&gt;30-90 天&lt;br/&gt;S3]&#10;        ARCHIVE[归档&lt;br/&gt;90+ 天&lt;br/&gt;Glacier]&#10;    end&#10;    HOT --&gt; WARM --&gt; COLD --&gt; ARCHIVE\">graph LR\n    subgraph 日志分层存储\n        HOT[热存储&lt;br/&gt;最近 7 天&lt;br/&gt;SSD]\n        WARM[温存储&lt;br/&gt;7-30 天&lt;br/&gt;HDD]\n        COLD[冷存储&lt;br/&gt;30-90 天&lt;br/&gt;S3]\n        ARCHIVE[归档&lt;br/&gt;90+ 天&lt;br/&gt;Glacier]\n    end\n    HOT --&gt; WARM --&gt; COLD --&gt; ARCHIVE</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储层</th>\n<th>保留时间</th>\n<th>存储介质</th>\n<th>查询速度</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热存储</td>\n<td>0-7 天</td>\n<td>SSD</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温存储</td>\n<td>7-30 天</td>\n<td>HDD</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷存储</td>\n<td>30-90 天</td>\n<td>S3</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归档</td>\n<td>90+ 天</td>\n<td>Glacier</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((日志体系))&#10;    挑战&#10;      容器临时性&#10;      日志分散&#10;      格式异构&#10;    结构化日志&#10;      JSON 格式&#10;      trace_id 关联&#10;      机器可解析&#10;    EFK 栈&#10;      Fluent Bit 采集&#10;      Elasticsearch 存储&#10;      Kibana 可视化&#10;    查询分析&#10;      kubectl logs&#10;      Kibana 搜索&#10;      stern 工具&#10;    成本管理&#10;      分层存储&#10;      保留策略&#10;      冷热分离\">mindmap\n  root((日志体系))\n    挑战\n      容器临时性\n      日志分散\n      格式异构\n    结构化日志\n      JSON 格式\n      trace_id 关联\n      机器可解析\n    EFK 栈\n      Fluent Bit 采集\n      Elasticsearch 存储\n      Kibana 可视化\n    查询分析\n      kubectl logs\n      Kibana 搜索\n      stern 工具\n    成本管理\n      分层存储\n      保留策略\n      冷热分离</pre><ul>\n<li>容器化环境的日志管理面临临时性、分散性和异构性三大挑战。</li>\n<li><strong>结构化 JSON 日志</strong>是可观测性的基础，<code>trace_id</code> 字段实现跨服务日志关联。</li>\n<li>EFK 栈（Fluent Bit + Elasticsearch + Kibana）是 Kubernetes 日志的主流方案。</li>\n<li>掌握 <code>kubectl logs</code>、Kibana 查询和 <code>stern</code> 工具，可显著加速问题排查。</li>\n<li>通过热/温/冷/归档分层存储策略平衡查询性能和存储成本。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"日志体系","id":"日志体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"日志的价值与挑战","id":"日志的价值与挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"结构化日志","id":"结构化日志"},{"level":2,"text":"EFK 日志栈","id":"efk-日志栈"},{"level":3,"text":"Fluent Bit 配置","id":"fluent-bit-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"日志查询与分析","id":"日志查询与分析"},{"level":2,"text":"日志保留与成本","id":"日志保留与成本"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"部署策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/deployment-strategies"},"next":{"title":"指标与告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/monitoring-and-operations/metrics-and-alerting"}}